        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">A <gr str="7892">Song </gr>of <gr str="4609">degrees </gr>of <gr str="1732">David</gr>.</STYLE> Behold, how <gr str="2896">good </gr>and how <gr str="5273">pleasant </gr>
